OL,3,GNEWSASenior police officer charged with
OL,4,Asex offence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serving senior police officer has
OL,7,Fappeared in court charged with a sex
OL,8,Foffence.
OL,10,FDarren McGrath, who worked as a chief
OL,11,Finspector for Staffordshire Police, has
OL,12,Fbeen charged with sexual assault by
OL,13,Fpenetration against a woman aged 16 or
OL,14,Fover, alleged to have taken place
OL,15,Fbetween 1 July 2015 and 31 July 2016.
OL,17,FAt Cannock Magistrates Court on Friday,
OL,18,Fthe 44-year-old, of Stoke-on-Trent,
OL,19,Fspoke only to confirm his name.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
